  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4906.01 Application for Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4906.01 Application for Approval.\n\n(a) An entity that wants to have its training program accepted under these rules shall submit to the commissioner the following:\n\n(1) The training program’s curriculum; and\n\n(2) A copy of the training program’s educational materials.\n\n(b) Upon receipt of a request for approval of its training program, the fire marshal shall schedule a time for the entity to provide a presentation.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
